OL,3,GNEWSAKingfishr to perform in one of
OL,4,Atheir 'favourite towns in Ireland'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey have been described as the hottest
OL,7,Fticket in Ireland and, after an
OL,8,Fimpromptu performance in a Londonderry
OL,9,Fpub in February, Kingfishr are back `
OL,10,Fthis time to sing to thousands.
OL,12,FThe Limerick indie-folk group will
OL,13,Fperform at Live at the Square in
OL,14,FEbrington on Monday evening in front of
OL,15,Faround six thousand fans.
OL,17,FMembers Eddie Keogh, Eoghan 'McGoo'
OL,18,FMcGrath and Eoin 'Fitz' Fitzgibbon `
OL,19,Fhave emerged as one of the top Irish
OL,20,Fbands in recent years and their
OL,21,Fpopularity is growing.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
